              "type": "adjustResource",
              "resource": "exotics",
              "delta": -1
            },
            {
              "type": "log",
              "text": "{self.name} sold the thing from the rock to someone who asked no questions and paid as if they knew the answers. The treasury is heavier. Somewhere, the thing is being studied by hands {self.name} will never see."
            }
          ]
        },
