              "type": "log",
              "text": "{comrade.name} needed the oath more than {self.name} did this year, and {self.name} stood for them at a cost — publicly, expensively, the way oaths are meant to be kept. The cohort that watched the swearing has long since scattered. The ones who hear of this will understand what it was."
            }
          ]
        },
